{
    "title": "YachtWorld",
    "description": "In the market for a yacht or just love browsing the world\u2019s most beautiful boats? The YachtWorld app brings the largest selection of yachts in the world to your mobile device, so you can explore new and used yachts anytime. \r\n\r\nEasily browse, sort and share listings, videos and photos from the largest database of yachts for sale. Featuring more than 50,000 of the world\u2019s finest new and used yachts, power boats, and sailboats, YachtWorld provides an extensive set of filters and sorting options to narrow down the choices for the perfect yacht. The app gives you the tools to take the next step when you\u2019re ready - save your favorite boats, get alerts when new boats are listed and contact the seller directly anytime. The YachtWorld app gives you everything you need to find your dream yacht - at your fingertips. \r\n\r\n\u27a4 BROWSE THE LARGEST SELECTION OF YACHTS\r\nYachtWorld offers the largest selection of yachts for sale in the world.\r\n\r\n\u27a4 SAVE YOUR FAVORITE YACHTS\r\nSave your favorite yachts and get updates about them.\r\n\r\n\u27a4 SHARE LISTINGS WITH FRIENDS\r\nTell your friends about the yachts you\u2019ve found - with the click of a button. \r\n\r\n\u27a4 NARROW DOWN YOUR SEARCH\r\nEasily browse, search and sort yachts by price, make, size, location and more.\r\n\r\n\u27a4 DETAILED YACHT LISTINGS\r\nScroll through multiple photos and check out specifics about what makes each yacht unique. \r\n\r\n\u27a4 CONTACT SELLERS\r\nFound the perfect yacht? Contact the seller directly from the app.",
